  "scope": "Auditing exactly preserves both original trajectories. The 20 ms large velocity jump occurs in the second-stage solve at equation start 1.3141421356 s, not in its affine seed. Large Newton corrections precede the distant converged state. This locates the jump but does not prove that another initial guess finds a bounded root. This profile uses regularized Coulomb friction; all sampled contact-memory states and audited bristle rates are zero. No browser, accuracy or hardware qualification."
}
